From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chromium-blink-ios <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iOS extensions: scripting permission, tabs.TAB_ID_NONE, and native permissions prompt

Add tabs.TAB_ID_NONE (-1) to the iOS tabs schema, register the MV3 scripting API
permission and permission feature in IOSExtensionsAPIProvider so extensions like
uBlock Origin Lite load cleanly, and implement GetNativeWindowForFunction and
CreateInstallPromptForNativeWindow in IOSExtensionsBrowserClient using a native
UIAlertController with transition-aware presentation and a dealloc sentinel so
chrome.permissions.request() always settles.

